"spark-vllm-docker" by Eugene Rakhmatulin
(https://github.com/eugr/spark-vllm-docker), which is MIT-licensed. The
upstream launcher is cloned at a pinned commit; it is not vendored into this
repository. Its MIT license is reproduced in full below.

The serving image "eugr/spark-vllm-b12x:latest" is a community build that
packages vLLM (Apache-2.0), FlashInfer (Apache-2.0), and the
local-inference-lab B12X fork. The image is pulled from Docker Hub and is not
redistributed by this repository.

The model weights "nvidia/GLM-5.3-Flash-FP4-Local" are governed by the
